class libraries, WPF, and in-box Windows APIs. There is no vendored third-party
source in this repository.

The self-contained build is the one exception, and it is a packaging one rather
than a source one: `dotnet publish --self-contained` lays the .NET runtime and
the WPF assemblies down beside HERO.exe. Those are Microsoft's work, licensed
under the MIT License, and the MIT License requires its notice to travel with
substantial portions of the software.

